  "slug": "fresh-restaurant-style-salsa",
  "name": "Fresh Restaurant-Style Salsa",
  "recipe_type": "appetizer",
  "brief_description": "This fresh restaurant-style salsa recipe with tomatoes is easy to make in a food processor with a mix of ripe and canned Romas, onion, garlic, and peppers.",
  "cuisine": "Mexican",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Combine canned and fresh Roma tomatoes, onion, and garlic in the bowl of a food processor; pulse 5 times to chop. Add cilantro, serrano and jalape\u00f1o peppers, lime juice, salt, and cumin; process for 10 seconds. Pulse further until desired consistency is reached."
    }
  ],
